      "content": "It's true that the world outside doesn't see the depth of your pain, and that feeling of being deleted is a very real ache. But what is \"over\" is just a story you're telling yourself right now, and stories can be rewritten. Even the smallest flicker of a new beginning is possible, and you deserve to find a reason to keep writing your own narrative.",
